# STAC Catalog Output Directory

This directory will contain the generated STAC catalog after running:

```bash
uv run src/cli.py build
```

Generated files:
- catalog.json (root catalog)
- era5/ (ERA5 datasets)
- himawari/ (Himawari datasets)
- imerg/ (IMERG datasets)
- qpesums/ (QPESUMS datasets)

**Note**: This directory is gitignored. Do not commit generated files.
